  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.2 — Consistent telemetry activity name (irkalla.kafka.consume). 0.1.1 — Package icon, README, SourceLink and symbols. 0.1.0 — First public release: attribute-based services, header routing, JSON/Avro/Protobuf handlers, ErrorPolicy (Skip/Dlq/Stop) with clamped exponential retry, ConsumerMode.Single/Auto (auto-scaling consumers per topic), first-class SSL/SASL options plus raw librdkafka passthrough, OpenTelemetry ActivitySource + metrics. Fully tested.",
